    "body": "Addressed the merge conflict with `upstream/main` (`4e0b9abef`):\n\n- There were no review findings on `b94b2dc9b`. The PR carried the `conflicts` label and was already a draft.\n- Merged `upstream/main` into `issue/1953-ui-refit-test-plan` with a merge commit (no rebase, no force-push).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: kept both sides of the test module list (`page_layout` and `anchors` with `stock_fit`, `ribbon_rows`, `theme_op_tabs_tree`, and `theme_tree_hits`).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/layout.rs`: updated `the_viewport_row_is_inert_and_the_door_dismisses_outside` to read the `Panels` button and `MenuItem` AccessKit nodes from `main`, and kept `anchors::chrome_point` instead of a fixed screen point. Pinned by `layout::the_viewport_row_is_inert_and_the_door_dismisses_outside`.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`: updated `layout_page_tool` to pin the selected Tool Properties anchors (`Tool: EM-0600-4FL`, `Type`, `Diameter`, `Corner radius`, and `Flute length`) after #2002 moved the catalog controls out of that page. Pinned by `page_layout::layout_page_tool`.\n- `AGENTS.md` and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs` merged cleanly and kept both sides.\n\nHead: `1db14b7ae6acfcfe11d5c80b86cbf642e22d56ce`.\n\nGate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 8 steps (`camcraft-ui` lib 980 passed, 6 ignored; `boundary` 3; `boundary_picks` 6; `sinker_setup` 2; `tap_hand` 3; `theme_files` 15; `waterjet_tool` 1). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\n\nPlease re-check and review this head.\n",
