    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T21:23:58Z",
    "body": "Merge-time refresh: the head is now `1db14b7ae6acfcfe11d5c80b86cbf642e22d56ce`. mkinney pushed this merge of `main` first. I made the same merge locally, compared the two results, and did not push my result. The two results are equal except for two more anchors in the pushed `layout_page_tool`. The pushed head contains the current `origin/main`.\n\nResolved hunks:\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: the test module list. Both sides are kept (`page_layout`, `anchors` and `stock_fit`, `ribbon_rows`, `theme_op_tabs_tree`, `theme_tree_hits`).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/layout.rs` (no text conflict, the build failed): `main` removed the `view_door()` geometry and now clicks the View door through AccessKit. The outside-press test now gets the door and its open rows from the live AccessKit tree, then calls `anchors::chrome_point`.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs` (the test failed): `main` (#2002) shows the settings of a named tool in Properties, not the catalog. The anchors of `layout_page_tool` are now the tool heading, `Type`, `Diameter`, `Corner radius` and `Flute length`.\n\nTests on `1db14b7ae`:\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -j 6 -- --test-threads=6`: 981 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- The `#[test]` count in the test files of this PR: 120 before the merge (`b94b2dc9b`), 120 after the merge.\n- The changed files have no CR bytes. No snapshot PNG changed.\n\nNo collaborator `pr-reviewer` marker is on this PR. Thus there is no delta class. The PR needs a full review.\n\nReady for a re-check. The PR stays a draft.\n",
